{"seq":17,"slug":"database-migration-patterns","title":"数据库迁移模式","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据库迁移模式\">数据库迁移模式</h1><p>生产环境的数据库变更是工程团队面临的最高风险操作之一。一条看似简单的 <code>ALTER TABLE</code> 语句，在十亿行的表上执行可能耗时数小时，期间所有写入被阻塞，业务完全瘫痪。2015 年前，多数公司只能选择「周六凌晨三点停服维护」；而今天，GitHub、Netflix、Stripe 等公司已经实现了零停机的 schema 变更——这背后是一整套经过实战检验的迁移模式与工具链。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>关系型数据库 schema 变更</strong>的工程实践：如何在不中断服务的前提下，安全地添加列、重命名字段、拆分表、变更索引、乃至跨引擎迁移。我们不讨论通用的数据仓库 ETL 或数据湖迁移（那属于数据工程范畴），也不覆盖应用层面的 ORM 使用技巧——而是专注于 DDL 变更从开发到生产的全链路。</p>\n<p>与同类 hub 的分工边界：微服务架构 hub 讨论服务拆分时的数据分解策略（database-per-service），分布式系统 hub 关注一致性模型与复制协议；本 hub 则从「schema 变更如何安全落地」这一实操视角切入，三者互为补充。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有运维经验的后端工程师</strong>：基础篇（理解锁与版本化）→ 模式篇（掌握 expand-contract 与 shadow table）→ 工具篇（选型 gh-ost/Flyway）→ 运维篇（CI/CD 集成与大表实战）</li>\n<li><strong>架构师或 Tech Lead</strong>：模式篇 → 运维篇（重点关注回滚策略与大表迁移）→ 基础篇按需补充</li>\n<li><strong>DBA 或平台工程师</strong>：工具篇 → 运维篇 → 模式篇（理解应用层配合）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前置知识：SQL DDL/DML 基本概念、关系型数据库锁机制的初步了解、对 MySQL 或 PostgreSQL 至少一种有实际使用经验。了解 CI/CD 基本流程将有助于理解运维篇内容。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"schema-change-challenges","title":"Schema 变更的本质挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/foundations/schema-change-challenges"},{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-versioning","title":"迁移版本化管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/foundations/migration-versioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"locking-and-concurrency","title":"锁机制与并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/foundations/locking-and-concurrency"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"迁移模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"expand-contract","title":"Expand-Contract 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/expand-contract"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shadow-table-swap","title":"Shadow Table Swap 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/shadow-table-swap"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dual-write-and-cdc","title":"Dual-Write 与 CDC 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/dual-write-and-cdc"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tooling","title":"工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flyway-and-liquibase","title":"Flyway 与 Liquibase 版本化工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/flyway-and-liquibase"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gh-ost-and-pt-osc","title":"gh-ost 与 pt-online-schema-change","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/gh-ost-and-pt-osc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"postgres-migration-tools","title":"PostgreSQL 迁移工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/postgres-migration-tools"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-integration","title":"CI/CD 中的迁移集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/ci-cd-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-strategies","title":"回滚策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/rollback-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"large-table-migrations","title":"大表迁移实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/large-table-migrations"}]}]}